tual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p119","quote":"六年，魯襄公朝晉。晉欒逞有罪，奔齊。八年，齊莊公微遣欒逞於曲沃，以兵隨之。齊兵上太行，欒逞從曲沃中反，襲入絳。絳不戒，平公欲自殺，范獻子止公，以其徒撃逞，逞敗走曲沃。曲沃攻逞，逞死，遂滅欒氏宗。逞者，欒書孫也。其入絳，與魏氏謀。齊莊公聞逞敗，乃還，取晉之朝歌去，以報臨菑之役也。"}],"rationale":"本篇欒逞從齊入曲沃攻晉的同一記事與齊篇欒盈可能相接，但字異及世系未核，先保留候選，不直接合併。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p119","text":"六年，魯襄公朝晉。晉欒逞有罪，奔齊。八年，齊莊公微遣欒逞於曲沃，以兵隨之。齊兵上太行，欒逞從曲沃中反，襲入絳。絳不戒，平公欲自殺，范獻子止公，以其徒撃逞，逞敗走曲沃。曲沃攻逞，逞死，遂滅欒氏宗。逞者，欒書孫也。其入絳，與魏氏謀。齊莊公聞逞敗，乃還，取晉之朝歌去，以報臨菑之役也。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m119-0003","start":3,"end":6,"surface":"魯襄公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001273","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m119-0009","start":9,"end":12,"surface":"晉欒逞","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001814","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m119-0021","start":21,"end":24,"surface":"齊莊公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000264","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m119-0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"欒逞","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001814","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m119-0043","start":43,"end":45,"surface":"欒逞","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001814","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m119-0059","start":59,"end":61,"surface":"平公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000416","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m119-0065","start":65,"end":68,"surface":"范獻子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001815","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m119-0075","start":75,"end":76,"surface":"逞","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001814","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m119-0077","start":77,"end":78,"surface":"逞","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001814","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m119-0086","start":86,"end":87,"surface":"逞"